License: GPL3
termination: false

This program includes shift overflow : a1 << 31 and bit operation;
This program is non-terminating, when a0 =0 and a1 = 0.


*/

int main()
{
    int a0 = __VERIFIER_nondet_int();
    int a1 = __VERIFIER_nondet_int();
